```Title: Cloud Instance Metadata Credentials Requested from the Command Line on Windows (raw Sysmon events)```
```ATT&CK: T1552.005 | Severity: medium | Sigma id: 816b8cfb-930c-4c4a-a49f-d4a2b69b388e```
```Data source: Sysmon EventCode 1 (Splunk Add-on for Sysmon). Change index to where your Sysmon data lives.```
```False positives: Scripts on cloud instances that fetch role credentials (most SDKs do not use a command line)```
```Suggested ES correlation search: cron */15 * * * *, earliest=-20m@m latest=-5m@m, throttle on the table fields, notable severity medium.```
index=sysmon source="XmlWinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" EventCode=1
(CommandLine IN ("*/latest/meta-data/iam/security-credentials*", "*/metadata/identity/oauth2/token*", "*/computeMetadata/v1/instance/service-accounts/*"))
| table _time host User ParentImage Image CommandLine
